{"seq":17,"slug":"mentoring-teaching-growth","title":"mentoring-teaching-growth","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth","rating":{"composite":4.03,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"导师制与教学成长-简介\">导师制与教学成长 简介</h1><p>教学是最深刻的学习方式。当你试图将一个复杂概念讲清楚时，你被迫面对自己理解中的每一个漏洞；当你指导一位初级工程师解决架构问题时，你自己对架构的认知也在被重新打磨。这种通过教学反哺自身成长的机制，已经被认知科学反复验证，也是无数资深工程师从&quot;能做&quot;跨越到&quot;能教&quot;的关键转折点。</p>\n<p>本手册面向希望通过教学与指导关系加速自身成长的程序员。无论你是刚开始带新人的中级工程师，还是已经承担技术导师角色多年的团队负责人，你都将在这里找到从理论根基到实操方法的完整路径。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>以教促学</strong>从认知科学出发，深入讲解费曼学习法的底层原理、被指导者效应的研究成果、以教代考的学习检验方式以及 ELI5 简化表达训练，帮助你理解为什么教学本身就是最强大的学习工具。第二章<strong>导师制框架</strong>转向关系设计层面，涵盖导师与学员的角色定义、情境化指导模型、教练与导师的区别辨析以及指导协议的制定方法。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>同伴学习网络</strong>跳出一对一的导师关系，介绍如何通过学习小组、结对学习、代码阅读圈和智囊团等集体形式构建更强大的学习支持系统。第四章<strong>内部培训设计</strong>聚焦于组织层面，讲解技术工作坊设计、技术分享课程体系、新人入职培训方案以及轻量级 Brown Bag 分享会的策划方法。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>反向导师</strong>探讨一种常被忽视的学习模式——由初级成员向资深成员传授新技术和新视角，分析跨代际学习的价值、新鲜视角的独特优势以及双向成长的实现路径。第六章<strong>知识社区建设</strong>将视野进一步拓展到组织和社区层面，讨论实践社区的构建、内部知识库的领导力、知识共享文化的培育以及开放知识运动的意义。</p>\n<p>建议按顺序阅读前两章建立教学与指导的核心认知，然后根据自身场景选择第三至六章中最相关的部分深入学习。如果你正在组建团队的学习文化，建议重点关注第四章和第六章；如果你更关心个人层面的教学相长，第一章和第五章是最佳起点。</p>\n<p>教别人，就是在教自己。让我们开始这段通过教学实现深度成长的旅程。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"learning-by-teaching","title":"以教促学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/learning-by-teaching","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feynman-method-deep-dive","title":"费曼方法深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/learning-by-teaching/feynman-method-deep-dive"},{"seq":2,"slug":"protege-effect","title":"门徒效应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/learning-by-teaching/protege-effect"},{"seq":3,"slug":"teaching-as-mastery-test","title":"教学即精通检验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/learning-by-teaching/teaching-as-mastery-test"},{"seq":4,"slug":"explain-like-im-five","title":"像五岁小孩一样解释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/learning-by-teaching/explain-like-im-five"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"mentoring-frameworks","title":"导师制框架","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/mentoring-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mentor-mentee-relationship","title":"导师与学员关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/mentoring-frameworks/mentor-mentee-relationship"},{"seq":2,"slug":"situational-mentoring","title":"情境导师制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/mentoring-frameworks/situational-mentoring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"coaching-vs-mentoring","title":"教练 vs 导师","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/mentoring-frameworks/coaching-vs-mentoring"},{"seq":4,"slug":"mentoring-contract-design","title":"导师协议设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/mentoring-frameworks/mentoring-contract-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"peer-learning-networks","title":"同伴学习网络","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/peer-learning-networks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"study-group-design","title":"学习小组设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/peer-learning-networks/study-group-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pair-learning-practice","title":"结对学习实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/peer-learning-networks/pair-learning-practice"},{"seq":3,"slug":"code-reading-circles","title":"代码阅读圈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/peer-learning-networks/code-reading-circles"},{"seq":4,"slug":"mastermind-groups","title":"智囊团","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/mentoring-teaching-growth/peer-learning-networks/mastermind-groups"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"internal-training-design","title":"内部培训设计","docCo